{"kind":"assert","text":"Additional acceptance evidence for #4161: the current daily token recipe groups whole-session totals by the last observed day, so a session crossing midnight moves its earlier tokens into the later day. Keep this correction on the existing competitive-analytics recovery promise; its event-time hourly table and query recipes already own the outcome.\n\nAt exact main 3a593721231326d589541113add606b270490e35, I ran the actual embedded activity-stats normalizer and session fold with two scrubbed Codex usage events in one session, then ran the exact [README query](tailapps/activity-stats/README.md@3a593721231326d589541113add606b270490e35:92) against the resulting row in in-memory SQLite. Same-day control: 120 + 120 input tokens correctly reports 240 on day 20702. Cross-midnight case: one 120-token event on day 20702 and one on day 20703 incorrectly reports only day 20703 with all 240 tokens. The earlier day disappears. This is a synthetic time-boundary reproduction, not a claim about observed installed data.\n\nThe [session schema](tailapps/activity-stats/application.sql@3a593721231326d589541113add606b270490e35:48) has one row per harness/session. The [session fold](tailapps/activity-stats/folds/session.jsonata@3a593721231326d589541113add606b270490e35:14) accumulates lifetime counters while replacing last_seen_unix_nano on each event. Grouping that row by its final day cannot reconstruct event-time daily totals. The paired [evidence](day-bucket-evidence.json) retains the actual rows and recipe results; the [probe source](day-bucket-probe_test.go) ran through a temporary Go overlay without changing the worktree or a live service.\n\nWhen delivering #4161, derive hourly values from each event timestamp and daily totals by summing those hourly buckets. Replace this recipe accordingly, with a same-session cross-hour and cross-midnight regression, including unknown/zero coverage as already required. Relabeling the existing query as sessions-last-seen-per-day would make it honest but would not fulfill the requested daily token accounting. No schema reset, installation or live telemetry operation is authorized here.","body":{"head":"3a593721231326d589541113add606b270490e35","stale_bases":"git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:0d7b7f21af90433b010ab3f9a6bbbc431f921613 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:2bb34990de179e860720e2a24007cfda625bce06, git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:406a2133d6b59f2fbca8aa23d175658d1cb65e82, git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:40725d2b2fc8f199fae768a6409ddf8423db25cc, git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:431d37832e19931da77b344f719807cc1d65dd94 and 31 more"}}